{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">歐洲國家聯賽，應屆世界盃冠軍西班牙，以4-1擊敗克羅地亞。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.EURO.SPAIN-0600_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026AQo6rpswuM1790726379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.EURO.SPAIN-0600_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">上場以3-2反勝英格蘭，紅衫的西班牙憑耶馬2分鐘入球領先。雖然28分鐘被對手追平，但只是3分鐘後，耶馬助攻佩比爾，再次領先。換邊後耶馬再有進帳，個人交出兩入球，一助攻。後備上陣的尼高拉斯威廉斯，89分鐘「埋齋」，西班牙贏4-1，在A3組兩連勝、排榜首，下場對捷克。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.EURO.SPAIN-0600_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026FUGIdW2Yp61790726399.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.EURO.SPAIN-0600_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T00:39:49.692123+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}